# Unlocking a Myth: Puppetmaster (jeuno 119): Lower Jeuno's Zalsuhm (no script; default 10085), the template
# UnlockingAMyth for xi.job.PUP (18). A level 75 PUP with the InfernoClaws (its Vigil weapon, Main slot) at 250 weapon
# skill points. Available: a trade: no trade handler; not wearing it: 10085; worn: 10086 (18), finished 0: nothing;
# 10086 again, finished 18: begun. Accepted: the cutscene 10087. (The worn weapon cannot be traded: #trade trades it
# unworn.) The other nineteen jobs' quests are silent (each check reads the main job).
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=PUP lvl=75
item InfernoClaws wsp=250
login
trade Zalsuhm InfernoClaws x1           # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # not wearing the weapon: 10085
finish
equip InfernoClaws Main                 # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (18)
finish option=0                         # neither 53 nor 18: nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # 10086 (18)
finish option=18                        # begun
trigger Zalsuhm                         # accepted: the cutscene 10087
finish
